        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    participant Job as \&quot;allocationJob: Control\&quot;\n    participant Run as \&quot;allocationRunService: Service\&quot;\n    participant Planner as \&quot;allocationEngine: Service\&quot;\n    participant ETA as \&quot;deliveryEtaService: Service\&quot;\n    participant DB as \&quot;PostgreSQL: Database\&quot;\n    Job-&gt;&gt;Run: startAtPublishedCutoff()\n    Run-&gt;&gt;+DB: Acquire business-date distributed lock\n    Run-&gt;&gt;+DB: Snapshot approved orders and shared stock pool\n    Run-&gt;&gt;+ETA: resolveScheduleDistanceAndEta()\n    ETA-&gt;&gt;+DB: Read versioned schedule, transit and distance cache\n    DB--&gt;&gt;-ETA: ETA inputs snapshot\n    ETA--&gt;&gt;-Run: Frozen allocation inputs\n    Run-&gt;&gt;Planner: planByServerReceivedAtAndOrderCode()\n    loop Each order line\n        Planner-&gt;&gt;Planner: Filter SKU, expiry, availability, radius, ETA and MLOR\n        Planner-&gt;&gt;Planner: Weighted greedy batch selection\n        Planner-&gt;&gt;Planner: Calculate post-selection HSD price fragment\n    end\n    alt All lines complete\n        Planner-&gt;&gt;DB: Persist proposal, prices and allocation trace\n        DB--&gt;&gt;-Run: AwaitingRunApproval\n    else Any line short\n        Planner-&gt;&gt;DB: Persist ShortInRun and rollback tentative draws\n        DB--&gt;&gt;-Run: Short result\n    end\n    Note over Run,DB: Tentative allocation does not change OnHand or Reserved.\n\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="hECMxBbB0jGWNqcO_AFE-1">
